    # "As I approached the gates, two guards crossed their halberds in front of me."
    "Ao me aproximar dos portões, dois guardas cruzaram suas alabardas na minha frente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:107
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_62408989:

    # "One of the guards addressed me with a heavy, hallowing voice:"
    "Um dos guardas dirigiu-se a mim com uma voz grave e solene:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:109
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_87c5b731:

    # GUARD "Your leave permit, scout."
    GUARD "Seu salvo-conduto, batedor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:110
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_e79ed82a:

    # MC "Huh?"
    MC "Hã?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:111
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_f00a0734:

    # GUARD "Present your leave permit, as dispatched by your direct commanding officer."
    GUARD "Apresente seu salvo-conduto, conforme despachado pelo seu oficial comandante direto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:112
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_db7eaca7:

    # "The guard sized me up."
    "O guarda me avaliou."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:113
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_29634847:

    # GUARD "That would be Captain Duprey."
    GUARD "Esse seria o Capitão Duprey."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:114
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_684e944c:

    # GUARD "And I suspect you have no such permit."
    GUARD "E suspeito que você não tenha tal salvo-conduto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:116
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_11238190:

    # GUARD "About-turn!"
    GUARD "Meia-volta, volver!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:117
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_45c36ccf:

    # "I watched them stand still for a moment and then turned around, disappointed."
    "Observei-os parados por um momento e depois me virei, desapontado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:119
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_391d3752:

    # MC "(It seems like I'm not getting out anytime soon.)"
    MC "(Parece que não vou sair tão cedo.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:120
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_73ac8739:

    # GUARD "Double-march!"
    GUARD "Passo acelerado!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:121
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_18c47396:

    # MC "*Sigh* Sir yes sir..."
    MC "*Suspiro* Sim senhor, sim senhor..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:127
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_61356499:

    # "That was the building they dragged that poor recruit towards."
    "Era o edifício para onde arrastaram aquele pobre recruta."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:128
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_a65eabce:

    # "Rows of actual comfy beds, shelves full of various potions and tools, civilian-looking people hurrying about past me..."
    "Fileiras de camas realmente confortáveis, prateleiras cheias de várias poções e ferramentas, pessoas com aparência civil apressadas passando por mim..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:129
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_172c8f4d:

    # "It was clearly a section of the fort fully devoted to supporting our physical well-being."
    "Era claramente uma seção do forte totalmente dedicada a apoiar nosso bem-estar físico."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:131
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_e5bd48af:

    # RECRUIT "Ow! What are you~"
    RECRUIT "Ai! O que você está~"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:132
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_3fa31f5f:

    # "Over at the corner of the room, a nurse and a physician were likely putting that recruit's face back together."
    "No canto da sala, uma enfermeira e um médico provavelmente estavam reconstituindo o rosto daquele recruta."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:133
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_098a2684:

    # "As I remembered the scene in vivid details, a snapping sound echoed across the room."
    "Enquanto eu me lembrava da cena com detalhes vívidos, um som de estalo ecoou pela sala."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:135
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_49cf0693:

    # RECRUIT "{b}Aaaagh!!!{/b}"
    RECRUIT "{b}Aaaagh!!!{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:136
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_c20f5bef:

    # MC "(On the upside, he won't have no face time with Captain Duprey anytime soon.)"
    MC "(Por outro lado, ele não terá nenhum contato cara a cara com o Capitão Duprey tão cedo.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:137
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_48a8e4c1:

    # MC "(I should go to the training area now.)"
    MC "(Eu deveria ir para a área de treinamento agora.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:138
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_73f8592e:

    # MC "(I don't want to end up in here, one way or another.)"
    MC "(Eu não quero acabar aqui, de um jeito ou de outro.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:142
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_d0e0fdb1:

    # "I approached the door and a guard standing beside it turned to face me:"
    "Eu me aproximei da porta e um guarda que estava ao lado dela virou-se para me encarar:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:145
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_3d0d779c:

    # GUARD "You have no business at the Captains office, recruit."
    GUARD "Você não tem nada a fazer no escritório do capitão, recruta."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:146
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_a6793028:

    # "His tone was even but surprisingly chill."
    "Seu tom era equilibrado, mas surpreendentemente tranquilo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:147
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_ba40941c:

    # MC "Yeah, I'm just looking around."
    MC "Sim, só estou olhando ao redor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:148
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_ec88e290:

    # GUARD "Sure, just don't bother me as you play inquisitor around here."
    GUARD "Claro, só não me incomode enquanto você brinca de inquisidor por aqui."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:149
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_6c2dfd73:

    # "I nodded and stepped back."
    "Assenti e recuei."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:151
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantEnterCaptainsOffice_2f9aca4a:

    # MC "(A guard who doesn't sound like he's eating babies for breakfast, who would've thought.)"
    MC "(Um guarda que não parece comer bebês no café da manhã, quem diria.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:155
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantGoToMedwardOrTrainArea_c1db863b:

    # "I should go to the barracks as instructed."
    "Eu deveria ir ao quartel como instruído."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:156
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CantGoToMedwardOrTrainArea_0d4c21ad:

    # "Last thing I want is for these guards to skewer me for displaying any disobedience..."
    "A última coisa que eu quero é que esses guardas me espetem por demonstrar qualquer desobediência..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:160
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_21ccfdff:

    # "I was approached by a rather hostile-looking guard."
    "Fui abordado por um guarda com aparência bastante hostil."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:163
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_2bb61eb1:

    # GUARD "Recruit! What are you doing loitering about after dark?!"
    GUARD "Recruta! O que você está fazendo vagando por aí depois do anoitecer?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:164
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_e55c35a9:

    # MC "I was just~"
    MC "Eu estava apenas~"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:166
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_d07274a3:

    # GUARD "I will escort you to your bunk now!"
    GUARD "Eu vou escoltá-lo até o seu beliche agora!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:167
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_0db79806:

    # MC "*Sigh* Alright, alright..."
    MC "*Suspiro* Tudo bem, tudo bem..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:170
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_a94b4f28:

    # "The guard did as he declared, following me around and even standing beside me as I was undressing to go to bed."
    "O guarda fez como declarou, me seguindo por toda parte e até mesmo ficando ao meu lado enquanto eu me despia para ir para a cama."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:171
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_CaughtOutsideOfAllowedTime_d738ea4e:

    # GUARD "Sweet dreams, soldier!"
    GUARD "Bons sonhos, soldado!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:182
translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_YourBunk_1a080f4b:

