    # "My thoughts naturally gravitated towards it being some type of contraceptive, but from Kiara's deathly face, I got the impression this was something else entirely..."
    "Meus pensamentos naturalmente tenderam a ser algum tipo de contraceptivo, mas pelo rosto pálido de morte de Kiara, tive a impressão de que isso era algo completamente diferente..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:243
