translate ptPT qst_ForgedInFire_TalkKiaraSuicidePill_0eb7df76:

    # "Kiara let the sentence trail off into nothing as her eyes looked up to meet mine."
    "Kiara deixou a frase se perder no nada enquanto seus olhos se erguiam para encontrar os meus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:251
